            "question": "I’m not sure where to start. Which products should I use?",
            "answer": "<p>Take our 1-minute <a href=\"/pages/skin-quiz\">skin quiz</a>. Answer a few quick questions about your skin and routine, and we’ll suggest products from our range, step by step.</p>"
