        "q_14": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I change or cancel an order?",
            "answer": "<p>If you need to change something, contact us as soon as possible. We can only make changes before an order has been processed or dispatched.</p><p>Once your order has arrived, you can still cancel it within 14 days of receiving your goods. See our <a href=\"/pages/delivery-returns\">Returns &amp; Refunds Policy</a>.</p>"
