        "q_16": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Where can I find your returns information?",
            "answer": "<p>Under the Consumer Contracts Regulations 2013, you have the right to cancel your online order within 14 days of receiving your goods, and a further 14 days to return them to us for a refund.</p><p>Please note that for health protection and hygiene reasons, we cannot accept returns or offer refunds on any cosmetic products where the tamper-evident hygiene seal has been broken, removed, or tampered with after delivery. To be eligible for a return due to a change of mind, items must be unused, in their original packaging, and have all hygiene seals completely intact.</p><p>If you are returning an unwanted, sealed item, you are responsible for paying the return postage costs. We recommend using a tracked delivery service, as we cannot be held responsible for items lost in transit.</p><p>This policy does not affect your statutory rights under the Consumer Rights Act 2015. If your product arrives damaged, faulty, or is not as described, please contact us immediately. You are entitled to a replacement for faulty items, we ask that you provide us with proof of images sent to our email address original@originalskinn.com prior to us sending out a replacement.</p><p>The full policy is on our <a href=\"/pages/delivery-returns\">Delivery &amp; Returns page</a>.</p>"
          }
        }
